### FILE
file_name: dins-setup.conf
file_type: config
language_or_format: nginx
role: Nginx server configuration that serves the frontend static files, proxies /api/ requests to the Uvicorn backend, and enforces security headers. Only responds to dins-setup.local hostname.
used_by:
  - ../Dockerfile.webui
depends_on:
  - ../../frontend/
  - ../../backend/app.py (via proxy)
status: active
notes: Default server returns 444 (connection closed) for non-matching hosts. Includes gzip, caching, WebSocket support, and security headers.

functions:
  - none
